	(text "Flow: terminal -> TVS -> reverse-polarity FET Q1 -> eFuse U1 (1.5 A limit, 5.4 V clamp, soft start)\n-> +5V node (TVS D3, bulk C2) -> amplifier, radar, glow ring.  +5V -> Schottky D4 -> VBUS_KEY -> FFC ->\ntouch board VBUS.  USB-C on the touch board stays usable: D4 keeps USB power out of the hub; D5 runs the\n3.3 V regulator from either side, so I2C, mic and the IO8 pull-up are live whenever the key has power."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "feba9e93-4874-5d9d-af08-7ccff6b1e4aa")
	)
