	(text "Amplifier and mic share BCLK (IO7) and WS (IO8): half duplex, as in the kit.\nNew: Q2 lets the I/O expander switch the amplifier hard off (mute). Firmware optional;\nwith the expander untouched the amplifier behaves exactly like the kit's breakout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 388.62 124.46 0)
