	(text "I2C addresses: TCA9534 0x20; VEML6030 0x10 and SHT4x 0x44 on the sensor tail,\ntouch AXS5106L 0x63 and IMU QMI8658 0x6B (both on the touch board). No clashes.\nExpander: P0 plate (in, low = pressed), P1 amp mute (out, high = mute), P2 radar OUT (in),\nP3 eFuse fault (in, low = fault), P4-P7 spare (firmware: outputs, low)."
